{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:48:754","content":{"id":754,"title":"微信读书","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"软件支持同步微信读书中的书架书籍详情，以及读书划线和笔记，这个功能主要的目的是可以搜集在微信读书上零散的读书想法和笔记，然后统一在软件中整体为卡片，也可以做一些统计，追踪自己的读书进度。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_db92f223-5b78-4a53-a924-3f13198257b5.webp","uuid":"a87cc7c6-67dc-44b9-86da-dca4c8769ddf","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_db92f223-5b78-4a53-a924-3f13198257b5.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"点击书名列右侧的按钮，就可以看到这本书所有的划线和笔记"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_6a0259f2-70a5-42fd-a394-3b503bd287e8.webp","uuid":"1ad9f9fe-f3c0-4c9e-bbf2-f90f65f2a69d","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_6a0259f2-70a5-42fd-a394-3b503bd287e8.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以对评论进行修改，以及对划线的样式进行修改，比如颜色等。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用此功能需要在设置的「集成」中登录微信读书"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2b99adcf-160c-4ff9-9e00-0a3dedd60530.webp","uuid":"3da5eb31-e62a-4fe8-8ca7-d7f67ca853c9","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2b99adcf-160c-4ff9-9e00-0a3dedd60530.webp","width":720}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"软件使用文档","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:735","type":"doc","id":735}},{"label":"功能模块","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:745","type":"doc","id":745}},{"label":"高级功能","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:769","type":"doc","id":769}},{"label":"微信读书","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:754","type":